                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/222: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Kaufman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-10-12T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 12,
                                1928—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>24. Your 46, October 12, 1 p.m. Your reply to the Bolivian officials is approved.
                    Take no further action without definite instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
